        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wa mũndũ, ana‐a‐ĩthe maku, o ana‐a‐ĩthe maku, andũ ma ũko waku, na andũ ma nyũmba yonthe ya Isilaeli, onthe, nĩmo ala mataviw’e nĩ andũ matwie Yelusaleme, Endai kũasa na Yeova; ithyĩ nĩtũnengetwe nthĩ ĩno yĩthĩwe ng’ũndũ yaitũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
